 "posts": [
  "POWER RESTORATION UPDATE\nAffected Areas: Portion of AGF3 - Portion Lagoon to 18th St.\nRestored at 11:06 AM\nWe are pleased to inform our valued consumers that our dedicated team has successfully restored power to the affected areas of today’s scheduled power interruption. This achievement comes ahead of our projected schedule.\nWe extend our sincere gratitude for your patience, understanding, and continued support throughout the restoration efforts. Your cooperation played a vital role in enabling our teams to work efficiently and safely in the field.\nIf you are still experiencing a power outage, please do not hesitate to reach out to us. Kindly send your account details and contact number, so we can assist you as soon as possible.\nThank you once again for bearing with us. We remain committed to delivering reliable and improved electric service to our community.\nSERVICE BEYOND POWER\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: SEPTEMBER 27, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa September 27, 2026 (Sunday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: September 27, 2026 (Sunday)\nReason: Removal of overhead Primary Line along Lacson St. From Capitol Lagoon to 18th Lacson St.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n6:00AM to 6:00PM\nPortion of AGF3 - Portion Lagoon to 18th St.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
